{"event_type":"review","id":"5add03b3731977719301d87b449c721dd8231ce573aa22f3863a35f6ab24d1cc","occurred_at":"2026-11-05T19:51:59Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/4054261d40e2def4faa9748552d0eeb26801c4d0dca1f23acab4d37776b28db1","sha256":"4054261d40e2def4faa9748552d0eeb26801c4d0dca1f23acab4d37776b28db1"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/bf4dc676d652be0aac462cc393bdf883be5bf807dfbfdf60ecea61154755c715","sha256":"bf4dc676d652be0aac462cc393bdf883be5bf807dfbfdf60ecea61154755c715"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/cffb079d868f1344a3d961494de65fa38ccd9598b38f9bec9572a188e4d80d2f","sha256":"cffb079d868f1344a3d961494de65fa38ccd9598b38f9bec9572a188e4d80d2f"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/1474a659d71ff2ec35d93a2f3c824bdb50e6d6644ab972b3d6c95542ecb2fb61","sha256":"1474a659d71ff2ec35d93a2f3c824bdb50e6d6644ab972b3d6c95542ecb2fb61"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/ad8bf2d7f94120e015146ea8b7934e4d2c3cf83f7fd08fe32d96e73041858c73","sha256":"ad8bf2d7f94120e015146ea8b7934e4d2c3cf83f7fd08fe32d96e73041858c73"}],"attempt_id":"b959b3886e480428407397dcd72e796f5caf3fe9aee29406052cdd2079375af6:0:1","base":"c2d49e4615a750dde6838ac749c25e48d27de02a","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"unverified","blob":"d1dfda6100cb662215eb6ea8e735318eb605ded0","body":"**Use `reviewBranchKey` for the record folder at `address.ts:791` and `address.ts:2151`.**\n\nFor encoded names up to 255 characters, `reviewBranchKey` returns the same value as `encodeURIComponent(branch)`. Longer names use a shortened key. The producer at `src/ops/review/run.ts:926` and the receipt allowlist at `src/ops/review/internal/addressBookkeeping.ts:63` both use `reviewBranchKey`. For names whose encoded form exceeds 255 characters, `src/ops/review/address.ts:791` and `src/ops/review/address.ts:2151` read a folder that the producer does not write. On common filesystems, a single path component longer than 255 bytes can fail with `ENAMETOOLONG`. At `:791`, a non-`ENOENT` error is rethrown. At `:2151`, the read is not guarded in the inspected code, so the operation throws instead of locating the producer's record for these branches.\n\nNames that fit within the limit produce identical keys, so this change leaves them unchanged.\n\n<details>\n<summary>🐛 Suggested fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n-              const folder = resolve(root, '.cq', 'review', encodeURIComponent(branch));\n+              const folder = resolve(root, '.cq', 'review', reviewBranchKey(branch));\n```\n\n```diff\n-                    const folder = resolve(root, '.cq', 'review', encodeURIComponent(branch));\n+                    const folder = resolve(root, '.cq', 'review', reviewBranchKey(branch));\n```\n\nImport `reviewBranchKey` from `./internal/branchKey` in `address.ts`. Use the module specifier style that the file already follows. No current import of `reviewBranchKey` appears in `address.ts`.\n\n</details>","id":"a4486f915aca8769b112ebb3e69860c3c12d487a3a56caeff4679007ec3fded0","intervals":[],"path":"src/ops/review/address.ts","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Use `reviewBranchKey` for the record folder at `address.ts:791` and `address.ts:2151`."}],"head":"f33578b195775abe93012bffa002775e97d95190","head_tree":"74119e2e60617e97b4070712a18195b8b48c1179","input_scope":[{"blob":"d1dfda6100cb662215eb6ea8e735318eb605ded0","intervals":[[1,2274]],"path":"src/ops/review/address.ts"}],"job_id":"b959b3886e480428407397dcd72e796f5caf3fe9aee29406052cdd2079375af6:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"residual uncovered lines"},"blob":"d1dfda6100cb662215eb6ea8e735318eb605ded0","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"src/ops/review/address.ts